rule NoExecutionByLanguage
	statement: Law L4. Saying 'do it', an agent tool call or a specialist recommendation is not authority to execute. Only the deterministic bank, on the current revision and with a customer decision or an active FrontierMandate, can execute. The assistant may analyse and prepare only; see AuthorityRule for who may do what.
	lineageTag: 4ced26e5-3296-54af-9bca-c6ab6d804945

	ruleReferencedEntity AuthorityRule
		propertyScope: specific

		ruleReferencedProperty Capability

		ruleReferencedProperty Actor

		ruleReferencedProperty PermissionClass

	ruleReferencedEntity FrontierMandate
		propertyScope: specific

		ruleReferencedProperty Status
